# 基本文章編集から文字をウインドウの外へ運んで、待たずに離す (design 11.3) のを、デスクトップの
# 文章編集とプロセスの文章編集で同じにする, for tools/ui_run.py. As ui_doc_drop_cmp, but the
# hand goes out of the window and the button is let go at once, with no wait on the way: the
# process hears the hand go out (OB_E_LEAVE) and asks the desktop to carry the letters on
# (DT_RQ_CARRY with DT_F_TEXT) after the button went up, and the desktop lets them go where the
# button went up. A document of one line, made here and opened as 受け先 with no object behind
# it, is moved by its name band to the right of the screen. A copy of 基本文章編集 with 30
# paragraphs (mkbig doc 30) is opened at 100,100 (600 by 400), the letters of the second line of
# its second paragraph picked, and carried out of the window onto 受け先. Saved, record 0 of the
# copy is the same, byte for byte, whichever editor carried them out, and so is the record of
# the one they went into (sum keys: it has the keys once the letters are put in it), 受け先 for
# the desktop's editor and 受け先2, made the same and put over it, for the process.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>受け先の行</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlopen 受け先
wait 500
drag 300 75 1000 395
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
drag 160 230 420 230
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
hold 300 230
move 400 240
move 600 300
move 800 420
move 900 450
up
sync 600
wait 300
sum show keys
keep kernel_to
click 400 112
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>受け先の行</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlopen 受け先2
wait 500
drag 300 75 1000 395
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
drag 160 230 420 230
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
logmark
hold 300 230
move 400 240
move 600 300
move 800 420
move 900 450
up
expectsincein 10 document: letters carried out (0)
wait 500
sum show keys
same kernel_to
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
